## Interface: 16001, 50504, 11509
## Title: zugzug_leveler
## Notes: Leveling guide for WoW: Forever and Classic Era / Hardcore (RestedXP routes for every race and class, its Survival Guide on Hardcore) and Mists of Pandaria Classic (quest log mode): an arrow, a coach that says why, quest data from AllTheThings, XP/hour, and a companion page.
