## SavedVariables: ZugzugLevelerDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: ZugzugLevelerCharDB

# One TOC for every game, as RXPGuides.toc does: a file tagged
# [AllowLoadGameType camelot] loads only on Forever, mists only on Mists of
# Pandaria Classic, vanilla only on Classic Era (its Hardcore realms too).
# Forever and Era share the talents, professions plan and danger list
# (RestedXP's classic data); each has its own routes and quest data. Mists gets
# its own quest data and quest log mode. Each data file is also picked at run
# time by Compat.lua's C.game(), because a client ignored a tag once (2026-10-18).

Compat.lua
Events.lua
Pause.lua
XP.lua
